    "text": "The amount of heat needed to raise the temperature of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>moles</mi></math> of a rigid diatomic gas from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> when no work is done is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>R</mi></math> is the universal gas constant)",
